{"seq":2,"slug":"schema-per-tenant","title":"独立 Schema 模式（Schema-per-Tenant）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/data-layer/schema-per-tenant","wordCount":1180,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"独立-schema-模式-schema-per-tenant\">独立 Schema 模式（Schema-per-Tenant）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Bridge 模式</strong>：在共享数据库实例内为每个租户创建独立 Schema（命名空间）的隔离方案</li>\n<li><strong>search_path</strong>：PostgreSQL 的 Schema 搜索路径机制，通过 SET LOCAL 在事务级切换当前 Schema</li>\n<li><strong>PgBouncer</strong>：PostgreSQL 连接代理，在 Bridge 模式中提供事务级连接池复用</li>\n<li><strong>N 次迁移</strong>：Schema-per-Tenant 模式下 DDL 变更需对每个 Schema 独立执行一次</li>\n<li><strong>DROP SCHEMA CASCADE</strong>：一次性删除整个 Schema 及其所有对象，天然满足 GDPR 删除权</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"模式定位与核心思想\">模式定位与核心思想</h2><p>Schema-per-Tenant（Bridge 模式）在一个共享数据库实例内，为每个租户创建独立的命名空间（PostgreSQL 称 Schema，MySQL 称 Database）。所有 Schema 共享底层计算和存储资源，但在逻辑层面完全隔离——每个 Schema 拥有独立的表、索引、序列和视图。</p>\n<p>这是 Silo 与 Pool 之间的经典折中：保留了逻辑隔离的安全边界，又避免了独立实例带来的基础设施膨胀。AWS 在其多租户参考架构中将此模式命名为 Bridge——桥接了强隔离与高效率之间的鸿沟。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph DB[共享数据库实例]&#10;        subgraph S_ACME[tenant_acme Schema]&#10;            T1_O[orders]&#10;            T1_U[users]&#10;            T1_P[products]&#10;        end&#10;&#10;        subgraph S_GLOBEX[tenant_globex Schema]&#10;            T2_O[orders]&#10;            T2_U[users]&#10;            T2_P[products]&#10;        end&#10;&#10;        subgraph S_INITECH[tenant_initech Schema]&#10;            T3_O[orders]&#10;            T3_U[users]&#10;            T3_P[products]&#10;        end&#10;&#10;        subgraph S_PUBLIC[public Schema]&#10;            META[tenant_registry]&#10;            MIG[migration_history]&#10;        end&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    APP[应用层] --&gt;|SET search_path| S_ACME&#10;    APP --&gt;|SET search_path| S_GLOBEX\">graph TB\n    subgraph DB[共享数据库实例]\n        subgraph S_ACME[tenant_acme Schema]\n            T1_O[orders]\n            T1_U[users]\n            T1_P[products]\n        end\n\n        subgraph S_GLOBEX[tenant_globex Schema]\n            T2_O[orders]\n            T2_U[users]\n            T2_P[products]\n        end\n\n        subgraph S_INITECH[tenant_initech Schema]\n            T3_O[orders]\n            T3_U[users]\n            T3_P[products]\n        end\n\n        subgraph S_PUBLIC[public Schema]\n            META[tenant_registry]\n            MIG[migration_history]\n        end\n    end\n\n    APP[应用层] --&gt;|SET search_path| S_ACME\n    APP --&gt;|SET search_path| S_GLOBEX</pre><h2 id=\"实现细节-postgresql-方案\">实现细节：PostgreSQL 方案</h2><p>PostgreSQL 的 Schema 机制天然适配此模式。核心操作序列：</p>\n<h3 id=\"provisioning-新租户\">Provisioning 新租户</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 1. 创建 Schema&#10;CREATE SCHEMA tenant_acme;&#10;&#10;-- 2. 授权应用用户&#10;GRANT USAGE ON SCHEMA tenant_acme TO app_user;&#10;GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON ALL TABLES IN SCHEMA tenant_acme TO app_user;&#10;ALTER DEFAULT PRIVILEGES IN SCHEMA tenant_acme&#10;  GRANT ALL ON TABLES TO app_user;&#10;&#10;-- 3. 在新 Schema 中执行建表迁移&#10;SET search_path = tenant_acme;&#10;CREATE TABLE orders (&#10;  id BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  customer_name TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  amount NUMERIC(12,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_orders_created ON orders(created_at);&#10;&#10;-- 4. 注册到全局元数据&#10;INSERT INTO public.tenant_registry(tenant_id, schema_name, status, created_at)&#10;VALUES (&#39;acme&#39;, &#39;tenant_acme&#39;, &#39;active&#39;, NOW());\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 1. 创建 Schema</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SCHEMA</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tenant_acme</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 2. 授权应用用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GRANT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> USAGE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SCHEMA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tenant_acme </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> app_user;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GRANT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ALL PRIVILEGES </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ALL TABLES </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SCHEMA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tenant_acme </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> app_user;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PRIVILEGES </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SCHEMA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tenant_acme</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GRANT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ALL </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TABLES </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> app_user;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 3. 在新 Schema 中执行建表迁移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> search_path </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tenant_acme;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> orders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  customer_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_orders_created</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders(created_at);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 4. 注册到全局元数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tenant_registry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tenant_id, schema_name, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, created_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'acme'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tenant_acme'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'active'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"请求级-schema-切换\">请求级 Schema 切换</h3><p>每个请求到达时，应用层设置 <code>search_path</code> 指向对应租户 Schema：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class SchemaPerTenantMiddleware {&#10;  async handle(req: Request, next: NextFunction) {&#10;    const tenantId = getCurrentTenant().tenantId;&#10;    const schemaName = `tenant_${tenantId}`;&#10;&#10;    const conn = await pool.acquire();&#10;    try {&#10;      // 使用 SET LOCAL 确保事务级隔离&#10;      await conn.query(`SET LOCAL search_path = &#39;${schemaName}&#39;, public`);&#10;      req.dbConnection = conn;&#10;      await next();&#10;    } finally {&#10;      // 重置 search_path 防止连接池污染&#10;      await conn.query(`RESET search_path`);&#10;      conn.release();&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SchemaPerTenantMiddleware</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NextFunction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tenantId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getCurrentTenant</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().tenantId;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> schemaName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `tenant_${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tenantId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> conn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pool.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">acquire</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 使用 SET LOCAL 确保事务级隔离</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`SET LOCAL search_path = '${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">schemaName</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}', public`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      req.dbConnection </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conn;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">finally</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 重置 search_path 防止连接池污染</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`RESET search_path`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      conn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">release</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>关键安全点</strong>：必须使用 <code>SET LOCAL</code>（事务级）而非 <code>SET</code>（会话级），确保连接归还连接池后不残留上一个租户的 search_path。</p>\n<h2 id=\"连接池管理\">连接池管理</h2><p>Bridge 模式的连接池设计比 Silo 简单但有独特挑战：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 应用进程&#10;        REQ1[请求 A&lt;br/&gt;tenant_acme] --&gt; POOL[共享连接池&lt;br/&gt;max_size = 50]&#10;        REQ2[请求 B&lt;br/&gt;tenant_globex] --&gt; POOL&#10;        REQ3[请求 C&lt;br/&gt;tenant_acme] --&gt; POOL&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    POOL --&gt; CONN1[连接 1]&#10;    POOL --&gt; CONN2[连接 2]&#10;    POOL --&gt; CONN3[连接 N]&#10;&#10;    CONN1 --&gt;|SET LOCAL search_path| DB[(PostgreSQL)]&#10;    CONN2 --&gt;|SET LOCAL search_path| DB&#10;    CONN3 --&gt;|SET LOCAL search_path| DB\">graph TD\n    subgraph 应用进程\n        REQ1[请求 A&lt;br/&gt;tenant_acme] --&gt; POOL[共享连接池&lt;br/&gt;max_size = 50]\n        REQ2[请求 B&lt;br/&gt;tenant_globex] --&gt; POOL\n        REQ3[请求 C&lt;br/&gt;tenant_acme] --&gt; POOL\n    end\n\n    POOL --&gt; CONN1[连接 1]\n    POOL --&gt; CONN2[连接 2]\n    POOL --&gt; CONN3[连接 N]\n\n    CONN1 --&gt;|SET LOCAL search_path| DB[(PostgreSQL)]\n    CONN2 --&gt;|SET LOCAL search_path| DB\n    CONN3 --&gt;|SET LOCAL search_path| DB</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计决策</th>\n<th>方案 A：共享池</th>\n<th>方案 B：分租户池</th>\n<th>推荐</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>连接利用率</td>\n<td>高（统计复用）</td>\n<td>低（按租户预分配）</td>\n<td>A</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>search_path 切换开销</td>\n<td>每请求一次 SET</td>\n<td>无需切换</td>\n<td>B 略优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接泄露风险</td>\n<td>高（需严格 reset）</td>\n<td>低（天然隔离）</td>\n<td>B</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总连接数</td>\n<td>固定上限</td>\n<td>随租户数线性增长</td>\n<td>A</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（池管理 + 淘汰）</td>\n<td>A</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>生产推荐</strong>：使用共享连接池 + 事务级 <code>SET LOCAL</code>。通过 PgBouncer 在连接代理层做 pooling，配置 <code>server_reset_query = &#39;RESET ALL&#39;</code> 确保归还的连接干净。</p>\n<h2 id=\"schema-迁移策略\">Schema 迁移策略</h2><p>Bridge 模式的迁移是 N 次执行（每个 Schema 一次），需要专门的工具链：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    MIG[迁移脚本&lt;br/&gt;V42_add_column.sql] --&gt; ORCH[迁移编排器]&#10;    ORCH --&gt; |并行 10 Schema| S1[tenant_001]&#10;    ORCH --&gt; |并行 10 Schema| S2[tenant_002]&#10;    ORCH --&gt; |并行 10 Schema| SN[tenant_N]&#10;&#10;    S1 --&gt; LOG[迁移日志表&lt;br/&gt;per-schema 版本记录]&#10;    S2 --&gt; LOG&#10;    SN --&gt; LOG\">graph LR\n    MIG[迁移脚本&lt;br/&gt;V42_add_column.sql] --&gt; ORCH[迁移编排器]\n    ORCH --&gt; |并行 10 Schema| S1[tenant_001]\n    ORCH --&gt; |并行 10 Schema| S2[tenant_002]\n    ORCH --&gt; |并行 10 Schema| SN[tenant_N]\n\n    S1 --&gt; LOG[迁移日志表&lt;br/&gt;per-schema 版本记录]\n    S2 --&gt; LOG\n    SN --&gt; LOG</pre><p>迁移编排器的关键逻辑：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function migrateAllSchemas(migration: Migration) {&#10;  const tenants = await getActiveTenantsInBatches(batchSize: 50)&#10;  const results: MigrationResult[] = []&#10;&#10;  for (const batch of tenants) {&#10;    const batchResults = await Promise.allSettled(&#10;      batch.map(tenant =&gt; migrateSingleSchema(tenant.schemaName, migration))&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    results.push(...batchResults.map((r, i) =&gt; ({&#10;      tenant: batch[i].tenantId,&#10;      status: r.status,&#10;      error: r.status === &#39;rejected&#39; ? r.reason : null&#10;    })))&#10;&#10;    // 检查失败率，超过阈值停止&#10;    const failRate = results.filter(r =&gt; r.status === &#39;rejected&#39;).length / results.length&#10;    if (failRate &gt; 0.05) {&#10;      throw new MigrationAborted(`Failure rate ${failRate} exceeds threshold`)&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return results&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> migrateAllSchemas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">migration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Migration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tenants</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getActiveTenantsInBatches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(batchSize: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> results</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MigrationResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> batch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tenants) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> batchResults</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">allSettled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      batch.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tenant</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> migrateSingleSchema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tenant.schemaName, migration))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    results.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">batchResults.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      tenant: batch[i].tenantId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      status: r.status,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      error: r.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'rejected'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    })))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 检查失败率，超过阈值停止</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> failRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'rejected'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (failRate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MigrationAborted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`Failure rate ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">failRate</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} exceeds threshold`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>迁移策略</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全量并行</td>\n<td>所有 Schema 同时执行</td>\n<td>锁竞争、DB 过载</td>\n<td>轻量 DDL（加列）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分批滚动</td>\n<td>每批 10-50 Schema</td>\n<td>部分租户暂时版本不一致</td>\n<td>重量级 DDL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金丝雀</td>\n<td>先跑 5% Schema，观察后继续</td>\n<td>金丝雀期间版本分裂</td>\n<td>高风险变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Expand-Contract</td>\n<td>新旧列并存 → 双写 → 切换 → 清理</td>\n<td>过渡期复杂度</td>\n<td>破坏性变更</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"性能特征与调优\">性能特征与调优</h2><p>Bridge 模式的性能瓶颈集中在共享资源竞争：</p>\n<p><strong>共享缓冲区（shared_buffers）竞争</strong>：所有 Schema 的热数据竞争同一个缓冲池。大租户的全表扫描会将小租户的热页挤出缓存。</p>\n<p><strong>锁竞争</strong>：DDL 操作（ALTER TABLE）持有 AccessExclusiveLock，虽然只锁当前 Schema 的表，但在事务 ID 分配和 WAL 写入层面仍有全局竞争。</p>\n<p><strong>连接数上限</strong>：PostgreSQL 的 max_connections 是实例级限制。1000 个 Schema 的并发请求共享这一上限。</p>\n<p>优化手段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>瓶颈</th>\n<th>优化策略</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缓冲区竞争</td>\n<td>按租户活跃度分组到不同实例</td>\n<td>热租户不干扰冷租户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接数</td>\n<td>PgBouncer transaction pooling</td>\n<td>支撑 10x 并发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大租户查询慢</td>\n<td>分区表 + 并行查询</td>\n<td>大表性能提升 5-10x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DDL 锁</td>\n<td>使用 <code>CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY</code></td>\n<td>避免阻塞读写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨 Schema 报表</td>\n<td>物化视图 + 定时刷新</td>\n<td>避免实时 UNION ALL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"安全强化\">安全强化</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- Schema 级权限隔离&#10;REVOKE ALL ON SCHEMA tenant_acme FROM PUBLIC;&#10;GRANT USAGE ON SCHEMA tenant_acme TO app_user;&#10;&#10;-- 防止应用用户访问其他 Schema 的表&#10;ALTER ROLE app_user SET search_path = &#39;public&#39;;&#10;-- 每个请求通过 SET LOCAL 显式指定，不依赖 role 默认值&#10;&#10;-- 审计日志：记录 search_path 切换&#10;CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION audit_schema_switch()&#10;RETURNS event_trigger AS $$&#10;BEGIN&#10;  INSERT INTO public.audit_log(event_time, username, schema_name)&#10;  VALUES (NOW(), current_user, current_setting(&#39;search_path&#39;));&#10;END;&#10;$$ LANGUAGE plpgsql;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Schema 级权限隔离</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">REVOKE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ALL </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SCHEMA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tenant_acme </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PUBLIC;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GRANT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> USAGE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SCHEMA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tenant_acme </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> app_user;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 防止应用用户访问其他 Schema 的表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ROLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> app_user </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> search_path </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'public'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 每个请求通过 SET LOCAL 显式指定，不依赖 role 默认值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 审计日志：记录 search_path 切换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE OR REPLACE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FUNCTION</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> audit_schema_switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RETURNS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_trigger </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $$</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">audit_log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event_time, username, schema_name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), current_user, current_setting(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'search_path'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$$ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LANGUAGE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plpgsql;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"租户数据导出与合规\">租户数据导出与合规</h2><p>Bridge 模式在数据主权方面有独特优势：可以按 Schema 精确导出单个租户的全部数据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 单租户数据导出 — 合规审计、客户离场、GDPR Right to Erasure&#10;pg_dump --schema=tenant_acme -F c -f tenant_acme_backup.dump mydb&#10;&#10;# 单租户数据删除 — 彻底清除&#10;DROP SCHEMA tenant_acme CASCADE;&#10;VACUUM FULL;  -- 回收存储空间\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 单租户数据导出 — 合规审计、客户离场、GDPR Right to Erasure</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pg_dump</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --schema=tenant_acme</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -F</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tenant_acme_backup.dump</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mydb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 单租户数据删除 — 彻底清除</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DROP</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> SCHEMA</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tenant_acme</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> CASCADE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">VACUUM</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> FULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;  </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">--</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 回收存储空间</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这一特性使 Bridge 模式在 GDPR 合规场景中特别有价值：Article 17（Right to Erasure）要求平台能完整删除一个客户的所有数据，<code>DROP SCHEMA CASCADE</code> 直接满足这一要求，无需逐表扫描。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Schema-per-Tenant 是成本与隔离的平衡点——单一数据库实例降低了基础设施开销，独立 Schema 提供了逻辑隔离和按租户数据导出的能力。实现时的关键是使用 <code>SET LOCAL</code> 确保事务级 search_path 隔离、通过 PgBouncer 管理连接池、建立批量迁移编排器处理 N 次 DDL 执行。此模式特别适合中等规模（100-5000 租户）的 B2B SaaS，在 GDPR 合规场景中因 <code>DROP SCHEMA CASCADE</code> 的干净删除能力而具有独特优势。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"database-per-tenant\">独立数据库模式</a> 提供了更强隔离的方案对比；<a href=\"row-level-security\">行级安全模式</a> 展示了更轻量的共享隔离方案。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"独立 Schema 模式（Schema-per-Tenant）","id":"独立-schema-模式-schema-per-tenant"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"模式定位与核心思想","id":"模式定位与核心思想"},{"level":2,"text":"实现细节：PostgreSQL 方案","id":"实现细节-postgresql-方案"},{"level":3,"text":"Provisioning 新租户","id":"provisioning-新租户"},{"level":3,"text":"请求级 Schema 切换","id":"请求级-schema-切换"},{"level":2,"text":"连接池管理","id":"连接池管理"},{"level":2,"text":"Schema 迁移策略","id":"schema-迁移策略"},{"level":2,"text":"性能特征与调优","id":"性能特征与调优"},{"level":2,"text":"安全强化","id":"安全强化"},{"level":2,"text":"租户数据导出与合规","id":"租户数据导出与合规"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"独立数据库模式（Database-per-Tenant）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/data-layer/database-per-tenant"},"next":{"title":"行级安全隔离（Row-Level Security）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/data-layer/row-level-security"}}